{"title":"P12138 - P12138 [蓝桥杯 2025 省 A] 寻找质数 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-12-P12138-P12138-蓝桥杯-2025-省-A-寻找质数-洛谷","date":"2026-05-11T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:50:12.241Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-12-P12138-P12138-蓝桥杯-2025-省-A-寻找质数-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"洛谷-P1238-寻找质数\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P1238-寻找质数\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"洛谷 P1238: 寻找质数\"></a>洛谷 P1238: 寻找质数</h1><h2 id=\"题意简述\"><a href=\"#题意简述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意简述\"></a>题意简述</h2><p>输入内容：一个正整数 <code>n</code>。<br>输出要求：返回第 <code>n</code> 个质数。<br>数据范围：<code>n</code> 在 [1, 10^5] 之间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"思路分析\"><a href=\"#思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路分析\"></a>思路分析</h2><h3 id=\"1-朴素解法\"><a href=\"#1-朴素解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 朴素解法\"></a>1. 朴素解法</h3><p>最直观的做法是遍历所有小于等于 <code>n</code> 的质数，检查它们是否为第 <code>n</code> 个质数。但这种方法的时间复杂度和空间复杂度都非常高，特别是当 <code>n</code> 较大时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-优化方向\"><a href=\"#2-优化方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 优化方向\"></a>2. 优化方向</h3><p>为了提高算法的效率，我们可以从以下几个方面进行优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>筛法</strong>：使用埃拉托斯特尼筛法（Sieve of Eratosthenes）来筛选出所有小于等于 <code>n</code> 的质数。这种方法的时间复杂度为 $O(n \\log\\log n)$。</li>\n<li><strong>上界估算</strong>：根据质数定理，第 <code>n</code> 个质数大约是 $n(\\log n + \\log\\log n)$。因此，我们可以用这个上界来筛选质数，从而大大减少需要检查的数的数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-最终解法\"><a href=\"#3-最终解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 最终解法\"></a>3. 最终解法</h3><h4 id=\"关键状态定义\"><a href=\"#关键状态定义\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关键状态定义\"></a>关键状态定义</h4><ul>\n<li><code>is_prime[i]</code>：标记 <code>i</code> 是否为质数。</li>\n<li><code>limit</code>：筛选出的小于等于 <code>n</code> 的质数的最大上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"转移方程\"><a href=\"#转移方程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"转移方程\"></a>转移方程</h4><ul>\n<li>如果 <code>i</code> 是质数，则 <code>is_prime[i] = True</code>；否则，<code>is_prime[i] = False</code>。</li>\n<li>如果 <code>i</code> 的平方小于等于 <code>limit</code>，则 <code>is_prime[i * i] = True</code>；否则，<code>is_prime[i * i] = False</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"核心代码\"><a href=\"#核心代码\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码\"></a>核心代码</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">nth_prime</span>(<span class=\"params\">n</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> n == <span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    is_prime = [<span class=\"literal\">True</span>] * (n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    limit = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(n * (math.log(n) + math.log(math.log(n)))) <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> n &gt;= <span class=\"number\">6</span> <span class=\"keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"number\">15</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(n**<span class=\"number\">0.5</span>) + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_prime[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(i*i, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>, i):</span><br><span class=\"line\">                is_prime[j] = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    primes = [i <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i, flag <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">enumerate</span>(is_prime) <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> flag]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> primes[n-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 易错点 &amp; 收获</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 实现过程中可能会忽略边界条件，导致错误结果。例如，当 `n` 为 <span class=\"number\">1</span> 时，直接返回 <span class=\"number\">2</span> 而不是 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在优化过程中，需要注意不要过度优化，避免不必要的计算。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(nth_prime(<span class=\"number\">10</span>))  <span class=\"comment\"># 输出：5</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 易错点 &amp; 收获</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在实现过程中，需要注意边界条件，避免错误结果。例如，当 `n` 为 <span class=\"number\">1</span> 时，直接返回 <span class=\"number\">2</span> 而不是 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在优化过程中，需要注意不要过度优化，避免不必要的计算。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h1 id=\"洛谷-P1238-寻找质数\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P1238-寻找质数\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"洛谷 P1238: 寻找质数\"></a>洛谷 P1238: 寻找质数</h1><h2 id=\"题意简述\"><a href=\"#题意简述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意简述\"></a>题意简述</h2><p>输入内容：一个正整数 <code>n</code>。<br>输出要求：返回第 <code>n</code> 个质数。<br>数据范围：<code>n</code> 在 [1, 10^5] 之间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"思路分析\"><a href=\"#思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路分析\"></a>思路分析</h2><h3 id=\"1-朴素解法\"><a href=\"#1-朴素解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 朴素解法\"></a>1. 朴素解法</h3><p>最直观的做法是遍历所有小于等于 <code>n</code> 的质数，检查它们是否为第 <code>n</code> 个质数。但这种方法的时间复杂度和空间复杂度都非常高，特别是当 <code>n</code> 较大时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-优化方向\"><a href=\"#2-优化方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 优化方向\"></a>2. 优化方向</h3><p>为了提高算法的效率，我们可以从以下几个方面进行优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>筛法</strong>：使用埃拉托斯特尼筛法（Sieve of Eratosthenes）来筛选出所有小于等于 <code>n</code> 的质数。这种方法的时间复杂度为 $O(n \\log\\log n)$。</li>\n<li><strong>上界估算</strong>：根据质数定理，第 <code>n</code> 个质数大约是 $n(\\log n + \\log\\log n)$。因此，我们可以用这个上界来筛选质数，从而大大减少需要检查的数的数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-最终解法\"><a href=\"#3-最终解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 最终解法\"></a>3. 最终解法</h3><h4 id=\"关键状态定义\"><a href=\"#关键状态定义\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关键状态定义\"></a>关键状态定义</h4><ul>\n<li><code>is_prime[i]</code>：标记 <code>i</code> 是否为质数。</li>\n<li><code>limit</code>：筛选出的小于等于 <code>n</code> 的质数的最大上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"转移方程\"><a href=\"#转移方程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"转移方程\"></a>转移方程</h4><ul>\n<li>如果 <code>i</code> 是质数，则 <code>is_prime[i] = True</code>；否则，<code>is_prime[i] = False</code>。</li>\n<li>如果 <code>i</code> 的平方小于等于 <code>limit</code>，则 <code>is_prime[i * i] = True</code>；否则，<code>is_prime[i * i] = False</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"核心代码\"><a href=\"#核心代码\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码\"></a>核心代码</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">nth_prime</span>(<span class=\"params\">n</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> n == <span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    is_prime = [<span class=\"literal\">True</span>] * (n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    limit = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(n * (math.log(n) + math.log(math.log(n)))) <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> n &gt;= <span class=\"number\">6</span> <span class=\"keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"number\">15</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(n**<span class=\"number\">0.5</span>) + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_prime[i]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(i*i, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>, i):</span><br><span class=\"line\">                is_prime[j] = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    primes = [i <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i, flag <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">enumerate</span>(is_prime) <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> flag]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> primes[n-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 易错点 &amp; 收获</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 实现过程中可能会忽略边界条件，导致错误结果。例如，当 `n` 为 <span class=\"number\">1</span> 时，直接返回 <span class=\"number\">2</span> 而不是 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在优化过程中，需要注意不要过度优化，避免不必要的计算。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(nth_prime(<span class=\"number\">10</span>))  <span class=\"comment\"># 输出：5</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 易错点 &amp; 收获</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在实现过程中，需要注意边界条件，避免错误结果。例如，当 `n` 为 <span class=\"number\">1</span> 时，直接返回 <span class=\"number\">2</span> 而不是 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在优化过程中，需要注意不要过度优化，避免不必要的计算。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12138","path":"api/tags/P12138.json"}]}